Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3

This image contains the "parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3" model by NVIDIA Corporation
(https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3), licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC-BY-4.0,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes: the official NVIDIA checkpoint was exported to ONNX with the encoder
switched to local (windowed) attention, a patched forward pass, and quantized to
int8 (encoder and decoder/joint network) by the
achetronic/parakeet project (https://github.com/achetronic/parakeet), model
image ghcr.io/achetronic/parakeet-models-asr-int8:v0.11.0. Voxen redistributes
those files unmodified.

